WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
at least

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:11,840
Follow Lin Mo

3
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:14,840
He will never go wrong.

4
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:24,870
Always changing directions from left to right

5
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,870
Could this guy not know the way?

6
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:27,870
so cold

7
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,870
Look there's a lot of firelight from a large army over there.

8
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:35,260
It's definitely safer to follow them

9
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,260
These white-eyed wolves

10
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,260
There's no real story behind it

11
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,260
When you see the large army, turn around and run away

12
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,580
So shameless

13
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:41,580
if it were me

14
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,160
Shouldn't have taken them in the first place

15
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,160
What the hell do they do?

16
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:48,470
Keep an eye on the path under your feet

17
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,470
Rest in place for half an hour

18
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:56,400
Replenish physical strength to Chongshou

19
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,400
There isn't even a defensive bunker here.

20
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,400
What to do if a vicious beast is killed?

21
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,400
go this way

22
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,400
you see

23
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,400
Or did you hear any ferocious beasts?

24
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:06,520
Is there really no fighting in this assessment?

25
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,520
A pure test of outdoor orienteering endurance

26
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,520
So far it seems like this

27
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:12,520
But the school will never let everyone have a pure heart.

28
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:13,520
There will be changes later

29
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:18,360
Why did it stop?

30
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,360
Did you realize you were on the wrong track?

31
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:28,820
We went in the wrong direction, right?

32
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:31,400
This is the entrance to the forest
